{
  "key": 37955,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_WelcomeToSingleDoubleChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Battle Castle!\r",
        "I am your guide to the Single and\n",
        "Double Battle challenges.\r",
        "Please be aware that these challenges\n",
        "are designed for a single Trainer.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue au Castel de Combat!\r",
        "Je suis votre guide pour les \n",
        "Combats Solo et Duo.\r",
        "Ils sont conçus pour un seul\n",
        "Dresseur.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_TakeWhichChallenge",
      "en_US": "Which challenge would you like to take?",
      "fr_FR": "Quel défi souhaitez-vous relever?"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_ExplainSingleDoubleChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "At the Battle Castle, you may take a\n",
        "Single or Double Battle challenge.\r",
        "Here, you are provided with Castle\n",
        "Points (CP) that you must manage.\r",
        "The CP are used for healing Pokémon,\n",
        "renting items or Berries, and so on.\r",
        "CP are earned by winning matches.\n",
        "The amount varies by how you win.\r",
        "The objective is to keep a winning\n",
        "streak alive while managing your CP.\r",
        "If you manage to win seven matches in\n",
        "a row, you will earn Battle Points (BP).\r",
        "If you want to interrupt your\n",
        "challenge, please save the game.\r",
        "If you don’t save, you will be\n",
        "disqualified from your challenge.\r",
        "Please be aware of that!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Castel de Combat propose des\n",
        "Combats Solo et des Combats Duo.\r",
        "Nous vous fournissons des Points Castel\n",
        "(PCa) que vous devrez gérer au mieux.\r",
        "Ils peuvent servir à soigner vos\n",
        "Pokémon, à louer des Baies ou des\f",
        "objets, etc.\r",
        "Gagnez des combats pour obtenir des\n",
        "PCa. Le montant de PCa obtenus dépend\f",
        "de vos performances.\r",
        "Le but est d’enchaîner les victoires\n",
        "tout en gérant au mieux vos PCa.\r",
        "Remportez sept combats à la suite et\n",
        "vous gagnerez des Points de Combat.\r",
        "Si vous voulez interrompre votre \n",
        "progression, vous devrez sauvegarder.\r",
        "Si vous ne le faites pas, nous \n",
        "devrons vous disqualifier.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_WelcomeToMultiChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Battle Castle!\r",
        "I am your guide to the Multi Battle\n",
        "challenge.\r",
        "Please be aware that this challenge\n",
        "requires two Trainers.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue au Castel de Combat!\r",
        "Je serai votre guide pour les\n",
        "Combats Multi!\r",
        "Ils sont conçus pour des équipes\n",
        "de deux Dresseurs.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_AskTakeMultiChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to take the Battle Castle\n",
        "Multi Battle challenge?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Voulez-vous relever le défi d’un\n",
        "Combat Multi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_ExplainMultiChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "You may team up with a friend for a\n",
        "Multi Battle challenge.\r",
        "Both Trainers are provided with Castle\n",
        "Points (CP) that must be managed.\r",
        "The CP is used for healing Pokémon,\n",
        "renting items or Berries, and so on.\r",
        "Trainers can use their CP on not only\n",
        "their own Pokémon, but also their\f",
        "partner’s.\r",
        "Both Trainers earn CP by winning\n",
        "matches.\r",
        "The objective is to keep a winning\n",
        "streak alive while managing your CP.\r",
        "If you manage to win seven matches in\n",
        "a row, you will earn Battle Points (BP).\r",
        "Please note: a Battle Castle Multi\n",
        "Battle challenge can’t be interrupted.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour les Combats Multi, vous pouvez\n",
        "faire équipe avec un ami.\r",
        "Chacun des partenaires reçoit des\n",
        "Points Castel (PCa) qu’il doit gérer\f",
        "au mieux.\r",
        "Ils peuvent servir à soigner vos\n",
        "Pokémon, à louer des Baies ou des\f",
        "objets, etc.\r",
        "Vous avez le choix d’en faire profiter\n",
        "vos propres Pokémon ou ceux de votre\f",
        "partenaire.\r",
        "A chaque victoire, les deux partenaires\n",
        "reçoivent des PCa.\r",
        "Le but est d’enchaîner les victoires\n",
        "tout en gérant au mieux vos PCa.\r",
        "Remportez sept combats à la suite et\n",
        "vous gagnerez des Points de Combat.\r",
        "Notez bien qu’au Castel de Combat, les\n",
        "Combats Multi ne peuvent être\f",
        "interrompus.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain",
      "en_US": "We hope to see you again!",
      "fr_FR": "A une prochaine fois peut-être!"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastle_Text_SelectPokemonToEnter",
      "en_US": [
        "Please select the Pokémon you wish\n",
        "to enter.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Veuillez choisir les Pokémon à inscrire.\r"
    },
